---
// src/pages/_site-updates/2026-10-31-horses-page-capability-accuracy.astro
export const updateMeta = {
  date: '2026-10-31',
  title: 'Horse breeding page: capability claims checked against the product',
  tags: ['horses', 'accuracy', 'genetics', 'inventory', 'bookings'],
};
---
<article class="border-l-4 border-[hsl(24,95%,53%)] pl-6">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">October 31, 2026</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
    Checked every capability claim on
    <a href="/horses" class="text-[hsl(24,95%,53%)] hover:underline">/horses</a>
    against the product and corrected the ones that did not hold.
  </p>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Corrected</h3>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>Gene counts now agree everywhere: 14 color genes and 15 inherited health conditions (adds PSSM and WFFS to the list). The unsupported breed-specific warnings sentence is removed.</li>
      <li>Buyer management now describes the Buyers &amp; Placement tab on each horse. Lead scoring, the six-stage Kanban, email tools and CRM analytics are removed because that module has been retired.</li>
      <li>Booking management now describes the real booking pipeline, the cap on bookings per availability window, and the Coggins requirement. Seasonal slot allocation and the mare approval workflow are removed.</li>
      <li>Semen inventory no longer promises 30-day expiration alerts, a Ship to Mare Owner action with carrier and tracking, or direct integration with breeding plans. It describes the lot events that exist, low-stock warnings, and the storage hierarchy.</li>
      <li>Foal heat tracking now describes the watch list that exists.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Added</h3>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>Embryo transfer plans with genetic and recipient dams and the ET certificate PDF; embryo inventory lots; CASA report upload with AI parsing; Pre-Foaling Alerts and the Mare Status board; mobile follicle and palpation entry with saved-offline writes; stallion dashboard tiles; Stud Service and Semen/AI Agreement templates.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</article>
